(P106 - timed manual magnetic field-survey diagnostic)
(Safe test: no axis motion, spindle, or probe move.)
(Arms READY_ACK, releases, re-arms SCAN_ACTIVE, holds 180 seconds, releases.)

(Start with the TMAG at a known magnetically clear location.)
